<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 447 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 447 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 447 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (Central Bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rate unchanged and bids accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY    BID   AMOUNT   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks    100    100	 8.50 pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks	5	5	 9.00</p>
<p>    10 years    100    100	10.25</p>
<p>    15 years    242    242	10.50</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	 447    447</p>
<p>($1= 8.7 dirhams) -- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
